1
00:00:28,833 --> 00:00:29,833
A rat…

2
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:33,233
Are you dreaming?

3
00:00:34,533 --> 00:00:35,900
There's a rat…

4
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,800
Talking in your sleep?

5
00:00:46,066 --> 00:00:47,665
You've got that weird habit too.

6
00:00:47,666 --> 00:00:49,333
You're the weird one.

7
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:52,166
You… you were awake?

8
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,366
Dreaming of your dad again?

9
00:00:57,733 --> 00:00:59,266
Not him this time.

10
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:02,900
Then who?

11
00:01:05,433 --> 00:01:06,433
You.

12
00:01:08,233 --> 00:01:09,266
Me?

13
00:01:11,333 --> 00:01:13,433
You haven't even seen my face.

14
00:01:13,866 --> 00:01:15,400
So how'd you know it was me?

15
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:17,900
Because...

16
00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:21,633
I know the way you smell.

17
00:01:28,033 --> 00:01:30,200
Song Yi.

18
00:01:30,533 --> 00:01:31,533
Xu Feiyu.

19
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,300
Get up!

20
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:37,500
Yong Qi.

21
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:39,032
You're up early.

22
00:01:39,056 --> 00:01:40,688
Early my foot, look at the time.

23
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:42,366
Is Feiyu still asleep?

24
00:01:43,133 --> 00:01:45,633
He… he's still asleep.

25
00:01:45,966 --> 00:01:46,366
Hey.

26
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:48,533
Hey hey!

27
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,433
Song Yi.

28
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:51,300
Huh?

29
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:53,066
You're acting strange.

30
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:55,900
Strange how?

31
00:01:56,533 --> 00:01:57,533
Not at all…

32
00:01:58,733 --> 00:02:00,699
You two last night?

33
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:01,933
We slept great last night.

34
00:02:02,390 --> 00:02:03,889
Out the second we laid down.

35
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,333
Slept like babies.

36
00:02:07,033 --> 00:02:08,133
Really?

37
00:02:09,033 --> 00:02:10,066
Really.

38
00:02:11,700 --> 00:02:12,766
But then?

39
00:02:16,066 --> 00:02:17,200
So I hear you tried

40
00:02:17,366 --> 00:02:18,366
to sleep with Xu Feiyu?

41
00:02:19,100 --> 00:02:21,333
He… he told you even that?

42
00:02:21,966 --> 00:02:23,166
So no explanation for me?

43
00:02:23,766 --> 00:02:24,766
Ugh.

44
00:02:25,166 --> 00:02:27,966
I just wanted to try shock therapy.

45
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:29,366
Never thought it'd fail.

46
00:02:29,833 --> 00:02:31,500
Sister Yun chewed me out for it.

47
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:34,200
Tsk.

48
00:02:34,900 --> 00:02:35,900
Yong Qi

49
00:02:36,266 --> 00:02:38,699
I heard the line of guys
chasing you in college

50
00:02:38,700 --> 00:02:39,700
stretched to Europe.

51
00:02:40,666 --> 00:02:41,966
None of them did it for you?

52
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:44,800
You sure you're straight?

53
00:02:45,033 --> 00:02:45,266
Hm?

54
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:46,766
What are you on about…

55
00:02:48,333 --> 00:02:49,333
Hold on.

56
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,166
Song Yi.

57
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:52,500
Hm?

58
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:55,966
Don't tell me you're jealous over me?

59
00:02:57,500 --> 00:02:58,600
I'm not.

60
00:02:59,066 --> 00:02:59,500
Nonsense.

61
00:02:59,966 --> 00:03:01,066
So I'm right?

62
00:03:01,500 --> 00:03:02,300
Song Yi.

63
00:03:02,366 --> 00:03:04,065
No way.

64
00:03:04,066 --> 00:03:05,066
You're done for.

65
00:03:05,333 --> 00:03:06,766
You're really done for.

66
00:03:07,300 --> 00:03:08,300
I'm not, okay.

67
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,400
Stop pointing.

68
00:03:10,033 --> 00:03:11,033
Oh.

69
00:03:13,466 --> 00:03:14,466
Careful, careful.

70
00:03:22,066 --> 00:03:22,533
Yong Qi

71
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:23,566
I'm hungry.

72
00:03:23,566 --> 00:03:24,566
Look after him

73
00:03:24,766 --> 00:03:25,766
I'm off.

74
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,800
He… he… he left?

75
00:03:28,566 --> 00:03:28,733
You…

76
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,666
What were you two talking about?

77
00:03:31,500 --> 00:03:32,533
Xu Feiyu.

78
00:03:32,666 --> 00:03:34,699
How about you talk to me first

79
00:03:34,700 --> 00:03:36,133
about me trying to sleep with you?

80
00:03:36,833 --> 00:03:37,833
Um.

81
00:03:37,866 --> 00:03:38,866
I…

82
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:39,433
That was…

83
00:03:39,733 --> 00:03:40,200
probably…

84
00:03:40,201 --> 00:03:41,966
me talking in my sleep last night…

85
00:03:44,233 --> 00:03:46,533
I didn't know Song Yi was such a gossip.

86
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,833
And you're one to talk?

87
00:03:49,033 --> 00:03:50,033
What's he done to you

88
00:03:50,034 --> 00:03:51,200
these past few days?

89
00:03:51,533 --> 00:03:53,165
Are you two close enough now

90
00:03:53,166 --> 00:03:54,866
to be sharing secrets like that?

91
00:03:56,300 --> 00:03:59,466
It's not exactly a secret.

92
00:03:59,700 --> 00:04:01,799
No reason to hide it.

93
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,800
Huh?

94
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:04,966
Who exactly is hiding anything?

95
00:04:05,066 --> 00:04:05,333
You...

96
00:04:05,566 --> 00:04:06,933
What are you getting at?

97
00:04:10,300 --> 00:04:11,933
Don't say I didn't warn you.

98
00:04:12,100 --> 00:04:14,300
Song Yi has no sense of boundaries.

99
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:15,900
Don't let him lead you astray.

100
00:04:18,300 --> 00:04:20,033
He's the carer you hired for me.

101
00:04:20,233 --> 00:04:21,366
You could've told me.

102
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:22,500
Huh?

103
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:23,800
Ugh.

104
00:04:24,466 --> 00:04:25,900
Okay okay okay.

105
00:04:29,633 --> 00:04:31,500
Breakfast is ready on the table.

106
00:04:31,833 --> 00:04:32,833
Go on and eat.

107
00:04:33,266 --> 00:04:33,733
Okay.

108
00:04:33,900 --> 00:04:34,833
Eat with me.

109
00:04:34,866 --> 00:04:36,131
No, I have to run to the shop.

110
00:04:36,166 --> 00:04:37,166
You go ahead.

111
00:04:37,500 --> 00:04:38,500
Mm.

112
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:39,733
All right then.

113
00:04:43,333 --> 00:04:44,433
Song Yi.

114
00:04:46,200 --> 00:04:47,200
Song Yi!

115
00:04:47,733 --> 00:04:48,833
Yeah! I'm coming.

116
00:04:51,100 --> 00:04:52,533
Walk me to the parking lot.

117
00:04:53,533 --> 00:04:54,533
Sure thing.

118
00:05:03,833 --> 00:05:05,946
What're you looking
at with that look?

119
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:09,165
Ever since you showed up

120
00:05:09,166 --> 00:05:10,966
I feel like Feiyu's become...

121
00:05:11,300 --> 00:05:12,300
a different person.

122
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:13,400
That's not normal.

123
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,000
So what?

124
00:05:17,333 --> 00:05:19,339
Is how he is now bad?

125
00:05:20,233 --> 00:05:23,156
I don't know
if this is good for him or bad.

126
00:05:23,766 --> 00:05:24,766
Song Yi.

127
00:05:24,900 --> 00:05:26,966
Do you really see
Feiyu as a little brother?

128
00:05:30,633 --> 00:05:32,533
I don't even know what you're saying...

129
00:05:33,766 --> 00:05:34,766
Oh right.

130
00:05:35,042 --> 00:05:35,976
Weren't you off to the shop?

131
00:05:36,001 --> 00:05:37,300
Don't change the subject

132
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:39,100
I know exactly what you're thinking.

133
00:05:40,166 --> 00:05:42,100
You two are already swapping clothes.

134
00:05:42,533 --> 00:05:44,599
You come barging into his life

135
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,600
and if one day

136
00:05:45,601 --> 00:05:47,000
he learns about you and Song Yang,

137
00:05:47,253 --> 00:05:48,253
what then?

138
00:05:49,166 --> 00:05:50,466
Come on that's enough

139
00:05:50,666 --> 00:05:52,200
I know what I'm doing.

140
00:05:52,633 --> 00:05:53,932
Go on hurry back.

141
00:05:53,933 --> 00:05:54,999
Customers are waiting.

142
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:55,900
The obss lady's not there.

143
00:05:55,900 --> 00:05:56,900
That's no good.

144
00:05:57,066 --> 00:05:58,132
Go on, get going.

145
00:05:58,133 --> 00:05:59,133
Go, go.

146
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,200
Hurry back.

147
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:01,200
Go.

148
00:06:08,666 --> 00:06:09,666
Mm.

149
00:06:14,033 --> 00:06:15,166
I've gotta say.

150
00:06:15,433 --> 00:06:16,700
Yong Qi's cooking

151
00:06:16,866 --> 00:06:17,866
is unbeatable.

152
00:06:18,366 --> 00:06:19,366
Whatever she makes

153
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:20,733
comes out Michelin-level.

154
00:06:23,733 --> 00:06:25,000
Fries.

155
00:06:35,133 --> 00:06:35,733
Say ahh.

156
00:06:35,900 --> 00:06:37,500
Ahh.

157
00:06:49,866 --> 00:06:51,133
Tell me

158
00:06:51,533 --> 00:06:52,533
when your eyes heal

159
00:06:52,966 --> 00:06:55,133
what do you most want to do?

160
00:06:56,266 --> 00:06:57,633
Would you…

161
00:06:57,933 --> 00:06:59,533
want to do it with me?

162
00:06:59,733 --> 00:07:00,133
Yeah.

163
00:07:00,533 --> 00:07:01,533
I'll do it with you.

164
00:07:02,466 --> 00:07:04,033
That's not an answer.

165
00:07:04,433 --> 00:07:06,400
Doing it isn't the same as wanting to.

166
00:07:07,633 --> 00:07:08,733
What's the difference?

167
00:07:09,166 --> 00:07:10,166
Just say it.

168
00:07:10,332 --> 00:07:11,332
What do you want to do?

169
00:07:13,100 --> 00:07:14,366
There's tons of things.

170
00:07:15,866 --> 00:07:16,866
Then tell me

171
00:07:17,033 --> 00:07:18,966
the first one that pops into your head.

172
00:07:21,633 --> 00:07:23,433
Mm…

173
00:07:26,566 --> 00:07:27,566
Sunrise

174
00:07:27,766 --> 00:07:29,666
I want to paint a sunrise from a mountaintop.

175
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:31,800
That's easy.

176
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:33,966
Sure, I'll take you.

177
00:07:34,166 --> 00:07:34,966
Really?

178
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,000
Yeah

179
00:07:36,066 --> 00:07:37,400
I want to see the sunrise too.

180
00:07:37,866 --> 00:07:39,233
Then it's a promise.

181
00:07:39,533 --> 00:07:40,533
No backing out!

182
00:07:42,066 --> 00:07:43,066
Yeah.

183
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:44,100
It's a promise.

184
00:07:48,666 --> 00:07:49,666
Say ahh.

185
00:08:06,100 --> 00:08:07,100
Mmm.

186
00:08:12,666 --> 00:08:13,666
Mm.

187
00:08:14,066 --> 00:08:14,400
This.

188
00:08:15,033 --> 00:08:16,700
What is this thing?

189
00:11:12,233 --> 00:11:13,233
Sister Yun?

190
00:11:14,300 --> 00:11:16,133
Weren't you coming back next week?

191
00:11:16,333 --> 00:11:17,433
Why are you back early?

192
00:11:18,566 --> 00:11:19,166
Any later

193
00:11:19,166 --> 00:11:20,166
and the flowers wilt.

194
00:11:20,666 --> 00:11:21,666
You're so sweet.

195
00:11:22,033 --> 00:11:22,366
Come on

196
00:11:22,533 --> 00:11:24,000
give me one of those mom hugs.

197
00:11:25,266 --> 00:11:26,266
Come here.

198
00:11:28,900 --> 00:11:29,733
Here you go.

199
00:11:29,866 --> 00:11:31,066
Thanks.

200
00:11:31,766 --> 00:11:32,233
Oh right

201
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:34,199
I got home and Xu Feiyu wasn't there

202
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:35,266
I thought he was here.

203
00:11:35,500 --> 00:11:35,966
Oh.

204
00:11:36,233 --> 00:11:38,332
Song Yi took him out to clear his head.

205
00:11:38,333 --> 00:11:40,933
Don't worry, if they're
together he's fine.

206
00:11:41,333 --> 00:11:43,699
Seems that junior of yours isn't bad.

207
00:11:43,700 --> 00:11:45,033
Don't get me started,

208
00:11:45,133 --> 00:11:46,533
he's a handful too.

209
00:11:46,700 --> 00:11:48,932
But this time those two

210
00:11:48,933 --> 00:11:50,566
seem like two peas in a pod.

211
00:11:51,966 --> 00:11:52,966
Whoo!

212
00:11:55,933 --> 00:11:56,933
Whoo!

213
00:12:04,366 --> 00:12:05,366
Whoo!

214
00:12:07,700 --> 00:12:08,700
Oh sorry.

215
00:12:11,933 --> 00:12:12,933
Whoo!

216
00:12:13,666 --> 00:12:14,666
Hey?

217
00:12:14,733 --> 00:12:16,099
That guy over there

218
00:12:16,100 --> 00:12:17,399
did he come with you?

219
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:18,632
Introduce us.

220
00:12:18,633 --> 00:12:20,366
He's… my little brother.

221
00:12:20,610 --> 00:12:21,742
He's so hot,

222
00:12:21,766 --> 00:12:23,532
just my type of puppy boy.

223
00:12:23,533 --> 00:12:24,700
Puppy boy?

224
00:12:24,933 --> 00:12:27,132
You've never seen him get mean.

225
00:12:27,133 --> 00:12:28,232
Even a mastiff runs.

226
00:12:28,233 --> 00:12:29,000
He bites.

227
00:12:29,001 --> 00:12:30,032
Oooh~

228
00:12:30,033 --> 00:12:31,665
I'm warning you don't go near him.

229
00:12:31,666 --> 00:12:32,666
Hey!

230
00:12:32,933 --> 00:12:33,166
Hey!

231
00:12:33,500 --> 00:12:34,500
Hey handsome

232
00:12:34,733 --> 00:12:36,233
add me on WeChat?

233
00:12:36,633 --> 00:12:37,932
He's my real little brother

234
00:12:37,933 --> 00:12:39,032
so hands off.

235
00:12:39,033 --> 00:12:40,833
Our house rule is no dating while young.

236
00:12:41,766 --> 00:12:43,066
I don't mind.

237
00:12:43,366 --> 00:12:45,032
It's just WeChat

238
00:12:45,033 --> 00:12:46,699
I'm sure my "big brother"

239
00:12:46,700 --> 00:12:48,065
wouldn't mind, would he?

240
00:12:48,066 --> 00:12:49,099
Hmm

241
00:12:49,100 --> 00:12:50,100
I see.

242
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,000
Hey, handsome.

243
00:12:51,001 --> 00:12:52,032
What's with your eyes?

244
00:12:52,033 --> 00:12:53,199
Blinded by my good looks.

245
00:12:53,223 --> 00:12:53,923
Satisfied now?

246
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:55,599
Nothing to see, go dance.

247
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:56,733
All right, break it up.

248
00:12:56,933 --> 00:12:58,000
Go on, go on, go on.

249
00:13:00,166 --> 00:13:01,699
Quite the player, huh.

250
00:13:01,700 --> 00:13:03,100
And I don't even have your WeChat.
